[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568249151","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113083#issuecomment-3568249151","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113083","id":3568249151,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Uryk_","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T19:08:57Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T19:08:57Z","body":"This isn't really a bug. You could rotate the PlaneMesh 90 degrees and suddenly the size axis would be correct. \n\nThe thing is the x and y values refer to the x and y values of the Vector2 which is used for the size property. It has nothing to do with the global x and y axis. \n\nIn general, this is preferred since a mesh has no concept of rotation or global space. A plane is a 2-dimensional construct that only has knowledge of x and y coordinates. It just so happens that we align it along the x and z axis by default when you construct one in the editor and assign it to a MeshInstance3D","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568249151/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568263944","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113083#issuecomment-3568263944","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113083","id":3568263944,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ur2MI","user":{"login":"WhoIsRam","id":114957050,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtoa-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114957050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhoIsRam","html_url":"https://github.com/WhoIsRam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhoIsRam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhoIsRam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhoIsRam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhoIsRam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhoIsRam/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhoIsRam/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhoIsRam/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhoIsRam/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhoIsRam/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T19:29:26Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T19:29:26Z","body":"@clayjohn Thank you for the clarification, and that does make a lot of sense. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568263944/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568267722","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113083#issuecomment-3568267722","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113083","id":3568267722,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ur3HK","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T19:34:49Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T19:34:49Z","body":"@clayjohn But note there's `Plane.orientation` property which already refer to a fixed parent space (for the mesh itself, this does not involve any MeshInstances using it etc.). `Plane`-mesh is 3D, its vertices do have 3 coords each. So it does make sense to clarify how the 2D axes the `Plane.size` refer to are being mapped to the 3D axes of the resulting mesh.\n\nThe docs for `Plane.size` could clarify that, something like:\n```\nDepending on value of `orientation`:\n- `Orientation.FACE_X`: `size.x` refer to Z axis, `size.y` refer to Y axis.\n- `Orientation.FACE_Y`: `size.x` refer to X axis, `size.y` refer to Z axis.\n- `Orientation.FACE_Z`: `size.x` refer to X axis, `size.y` refer to Y axis.\n```\nWhen used in a `MeshInstance3D` these axes correspond to the instance local axes.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568267722/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]